Be Worth by 2030","src":"AOL.co.uk","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPdlFLa0M1SnNHcHg4ckNiUTlfT3gtR3ZTUkpqVlRwX0ZFcmUwMHhNVzBpS0RsaWlQeU1kZFVVQ0dLRzM1ZUZkV0pNOWFVRGFLQzFpdHFBRlptM2pMRWlEQTNMaHdMZjdtcUktUlFVUWFTcDhuMm45V3d3TE1WOUtWU2Zn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"到 2030 年，投資 Synopsys 股票 10,000 美元的價值可能是這樣"},{"title":"Synopsys enters USD 1 billion buyback: Synopsys stock gains 3.19 percent - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Synopsys 進行 10 億美元回購：Synopsys 股價上漲 3.19% - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Synopsys Signals Confidence With $1B Accelerated Buyback, Analysts Raise Targets","src":"The Globe and Mail","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"Synopsys 表示對 10 億美元加速回購充滿信心，分析師提高目標"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-12-22","period":"2025-10-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/883241/000088324125000028/snps-20251031.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Synopsys, Inc. (Synopsys, we, our or us) is the leader in engineering solutions from silicon to systems, enabling customers to rapidly innovate AI-powered products. We deliver trusted and comprehensive solutions spanning silicon design, silicon intellectual property (IP), simulation and analysis (S&A) as well as design services. We partner closely with our customers across a wide range of industries to maximize their R&D capability and productivity, powering innovation today that ignites the ingenuity of tomorrow.","zh":"Synopsys, Inc.（Synopsys、我們、我們的或我們）是從晶片到系統的工程解決方案領域的領導者，使客戶能夠快速創新人工智慧驅動的產品。我們提供值得信賴的全面解決方案，涵蓋晶片設計、晶片智慧財產權 (IP)、類比和分析 (S&A) 以及設計服務。我們與各行各業的客戶密切合作，最大限度地提高他們的研發能力和生產力，推動今天的創新，點燃明天的創造力。"},{"en":"We are a global leader in supplying the mission-critical EDA solutions that engineers use to design and test integrated circuits (ICs), also known as chips or silicon, and we are pioneering artificial intelligence (AI) driven chip design across the full-stack EDA suite to improve efficiency and accelerate the design, verification testing and manufacturing of advanced digital and analog chips. We provide software and hardware used to validate the electronic systems that incorporate chips and the software that runs on them, including cloud-based digital and analog design flow to boost chip-design development productivity. We also provide technical services and support to help our customers develop advanced chips and electronic systems.","zh":"我們是提供任務關鍵型 EDA 解決方案的全球領導者，工程師可使用這些解決方案來設計和測試集成電路 (IC)（也稱為晶片或矽），並且我們在全堆棧 EDA 套件中開創了人工智慧 (AI) 驅動的晶片設計，以提高效率並加速先進數位和模擬晶片的設計、驗證測試和製造人工智慧。我們提供用於驗證包含晶片及其上運行的軟體的電子系統的軟體和硬件，包括基於雲端的數位和類比設計流程，以提高晶片設計開發效率。我們也提供技術服務和支持，幫助客戶開發先進的晶片和電子系統。"},{"en":"Synopsys is also the global leader in engineering S&A software. Our Ansys solutions portfolio is widely used by engineers, designers, researchers and students across a broad spectrum of industries and academia, including high-tech, aerospace and defense, automotive, energy, industrial equipment, materials and chemicals, consumer products, healthcare and construction. These products enable customers to analyze designs on-premises and/or via the cloud, providing a common platform for fast, efficient and cost-conscious product development, from design concept to final-stage testing, validation and deployment. S&A products and services are part of our Design Automation segment.","zh":"Synopsys 也是工程 S&A 軟體領域的全球領導者。我們的 Ansys 解決方案組合被各行各業和學術界的工程師、設計師、研究人員和學生廣泛使用，包括高科技、航空航太和國防、汽車、能源、工業設備、材料和化學品、消費品、醫療保健和建築。這些產品使客戶能夠在本地和/或透過雲端分析設計，為快速、高效和具有成本意識的產品開發（從設計概念到最終階段的測試、驗​​證和部署）提供​​通用平台。 S&A 產品和服務是我們設計自動化部門的一部分。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Designing ICs involves many complex steps, including, among others architecture definition, register transfer level (RTL) design, functional/RTL verification, logic design or synthesis, gate-level verification, floorplanning, place and route, and physical verification. Designers use our EDA products to accelerate and automate the chip design process, reduce errors and enable more powerful and robust designs, with improved productivity for faster time to market.","zh":"設計 IC 涉及許多複雜的步驟，其中包括架構定義、暫存器傳輸級 (RTL) 設計、功能/RTL 驗證、邏輯設計或綜合、閘級驗證、佈局規劃、佈局佈線以及實體驗證。設計人員使用我們的 EDA 產品來加速和自動化晶片設計流程，減少錯誤並實現更強大和穩健的設計，同時提高生產力以加快上市時間。"},{"en":"As the availability and amount of cloud-based data storage grows, customer interest in accessing EDA on the cloud is also increasing as customers seek to benefit from the scalability and flexibility that cloud computing can offer to their flows and engineering teams. Our Synopsys Cloud offering provides customers additional options for accessing our EDA products in their own cloud environments and in the industry's first EDA Software-as-a-Service solution developed in partnership with Microsoft Azure.","zh":"隨著基於雲端的資料儲存的可用性和數量的增長，客戶對存取雲端上 EDA 的興趣也在增加，因為客戶尋求從雲端運算為其流程和工程團隊提供的可擴展性和靈活性中受益。我們的 Synopsys 雲端產品為客戶提供了在自己的雲端環境以及與 Microsoft Azure 合作開發的業界首個 EDA 軟體即服務解決方案中存取我們的 EDA 產品的附加選項。"}],"customers":[{"en":"In fiscal 2025, our total employee headcount grew by approximately 40% primarily as a result of the Ansys Merger. As of our fiscal 2025 year-end, our voluntary turnover rate was 5.7%. We attribute the strong retention of our talented workforce to several factors, including exciting and challenging assignments; growth opportunities; strong leadership and management; a culture grounded in our core values of Agility, Courage, Excellence, and Trust; competitive and equitable compensation and benefits; our leading products and technology; and the strength of our customer relationships.","zh":"2025 財年，我們的員工總數增加了約 40%，主要是 Ansys 合併的結果。截至 2025 財年末，我們的自願離職率為 5.7%。我們將優秀員工隊伍的強勁保留歸因於幾個因素，包括令人興奮和具有挑戰性的任務；成長機會；強有力的領導和管理；一種植根於我們敏捷、勇氣、卓越和信任等核心價值觀的文化；有競爭力且公平的薪酬和福利；我們的領先產品和技術；以及我們客戶關係的實力。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Within our Design Automation segment, we compete against other EDA vendors and against our customers' own design tools and internal design capabilities. The EDA industry is highly competitive. In general, we compete principally on technology leadership, product quality and features (including ease-of-use), license terms, price and payment terms, post-contract customer support, flexibility of tool use, and interoperability with our own and other vendors' products. We also deliver a significant amount of engineering and design consulting for our products. No single factor drives an EDA customer's buying decision, and we compete on all fronts to capture a higher portion of our customers' budgets. We compete with a variety of different EDA vendors, including publicly traded companies offering varying ranges of products and services as well as other EDA vendors that offer products focused on ","zh":"在我們的設計自動化領域，我們與其他 EDA 供應商以及客戶自己的設計工具和內部設計能力競爭。 EDA行業競爭非常激烈。一般來說，我們主要在技術領先地位、產品品質和功能（包括易用性）、授權條款、價格和付款條款、合約後客戶支援、工具使用的靈活性以及與我們自己和其他供應商的產品的互通性方面進行競爭。我們也為我們的產品提供大量的工程和設計諮詢服務。沒有任何單一因素會影響 EDA 客戶的購買決策，我們在各個方面進行競爭，以獲取客戶預算的更高部分。我們與各種不同的 EDA 供應商競爭，包括提供各種產品和服務的上市公司以及提供專注於以下產品的其他 EDA 供應商"},{"en":"Within our Design IP segment, Synopsys competes against numerous other IP providers and our customers' internally developed IP. We generally compete on the basis of product quality, reliability, features, availability of titles for new manufacturing processes, ease of integration with customer designs, compatibility with design tools, license","zh":"在我們的設計 IP 領域，Synopsys 與眾多其他 IP 供應商以及我們客戶內部開發的 IP 競爭。我們通常在產品品質、可靠性、功能、新製造流程的可用性、與客戶設計整合的難易度、與設計工具的兼容性、許可證等方面競爭"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"Design Automation","val":5302340000,"zh":"設計自動化部門"},{"name":"Design IP","val":1751838000,"zh":"設計IP部門"}],"total":7054178000},"prod":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"License & Maintenance","val":3489609000,"zh":"許可與維護"},{"name":"License","val":2010602000,"zh":"執照"},{"name":"Technology Service","val":1553967000,"zh":"技術服務"}],"total":7054178000},"geo":{"end":"2025-10-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3100095000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":1304236000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"KR","val":946999000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"Europe","val":888524000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"CN","val":814324000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":7054178000}},"peers":["CDNS","KLAC","LRCX","ANET","INTU"]}}